Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Unregister Estonian ID Card Personal Data Reader native host from all browsers
; Double-click this file to remove registry entries for Chrome, Edge, and Firefox

; Google Chrome
[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Google\Chrome\NativeMessagingHosts\ee.aarepuusepp.eid_pd_reader]

; Microsoft Edge
[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Edge\NativeMessagingHosts\ee.aarepuusepp.eid_pd_reader]

; Mozilla Firefox
[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Mozilla\NativeMessagingHosts\ee.aarepuusepp.eid_pd_reader]

